":"体","pinyin":"tǐ","traditional":"體","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"祸","pinyin":"huò","traditional":"禍","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fú","traditional":"福","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"将","pinyin":"jiāng","traditional":"將","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"shàn","traditional":"善","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xiān","traditional":"先","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shàn","traditional":"善","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"xiān","traditional":"先","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诚","pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"誠","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rú","traditional":"如","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shén","traditional":"神","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Jalan Suci seorang yang mencapai puncak Iman itu menjadikannya dapat mengetahui tentang apa yang akan terjadi. Negara yang akan berkembang niscaya ada gejala-gejala yang membawa bahagia, dan negara yang akan musna niscaya ada gejala-gejala yang jahat. Hal itu dapat diketahui dari tanda-tanda yang terdapat pada rumput Si atau pada tempurung kura-kura dan nampak pula di dalam gerakan-gerakan anggota badan. Tentang datangnya celaka atau bahagia itu, yang baik akan diketahui lebih dahulu dan yang tidak baikpun akan diketahui lebih dahulu. Maka yang beroleh puncak Iman itu akan seperti malaikat. (Shu Jing - Su King II 2.2; V.4.2). TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB XXIV (Iman dan Jalan Suci)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/24 - Bab XXIII - Tanda-tanda Ajaib.md","title":"Bab XXIII — Tanda-tanda Ajaib"}
